      "blocks": {
        "point-1": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "No PFAS. No PTFE. No coating.",
            "hotspot": 1,
            "text": "<p>The cooking surface is pure titanium, bonded into the body of the pan. There is no synthetic layer between your food and the metal — so there is nothing to scratch through, flake or replace.</p>"
          }
        },
        "point-2": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Release you build, not buy.",
            "hotspot": 1,
            "text": "<p>The LavaCell™ hexagonal relief holds a micro-film of oil in its valleys. Preheat, add a little fat and food lifts cleanly — then sears deeper with every cook.</p>"
          }
        },
        "point-3": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Heat that tells the truth.",
            "hotspot": 4,
            "text": "<p>A triple aluminium Thermal Core spreads heat edge to edge in seconds. No scorched centre, no pale rim, no guesswork.</p>"
          }
        },
        "point-4": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Every hob. Every tool.",
            "hotspot": 3,
            "text": "<p>Gas, induction, ceramic, electric, oven and grill to 260°C. Metal spatulas and whisks are welcome, and the dishwasher is fine on busy nights.</p>"
          }
        },
        "hotspot-5": {
          "type": "hotspot",
